---
title: Talent Network is open to everyone now
date: 2026-09-13
summary: Joining the anonymous candidate catalogue no longer needs a beta invite, and the list is now open to search engines.
type: changelog
tags:
  - talent-network
draft: false
---

[Talent Network](/talent) — the public catalogue where candidates appear anonymously by
skills and experience, never by name or employer — was gated to a beta group while it
found its feet. That gate is gone: any signed-in candidate can join from their
[profile page](/my/profile), no invite needed.

The catalogue list is also indexable by search engines now, so it can actually be found.

Nothing changes for anyone already in: your card, your handle, and what it does and
doesn't show stay exactly the same.
